Reason: port (Mareshine): the app's Subtitles in cutscenes (SMS_SUBTITLES) and the game's own subtitle option are one setting: the app's goes into the game's option when the options load from the card (so the options menu shows it), a change in the options menu goes back to the app, and movies follow it. Without the app (-1) the game's option alone decides, as on the GameCube.
--- a/src/GC2D/MovieSubtitle.cpp
